  "$((N_EXPOSED + N_GUARDED + N_UNKNOWN))"
cat <<'TAIL'
The checks come from the failures of ONE chain, and the degradations they were tested
against were built by the same author — so how much they MISS is unknown, and will stay
unknown. UNKNOWN means unknown, not fine.

This tool sees the parts of your chain that leave traces on disk. It does not see your
agent's judgement, your prompt's contract, or anything it could not read.
TAIL

[ "$N_EXPOSED" -gt 0 ] && exit 1
